5ebfc89ece40ac64b420ed7ef6e4be4e21f1feaba371db34c242ddd2707892b6","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-11-18T11:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:21:21Z"},{"id":763109579,"node_id":"RA_kwDOAZbyZ84tfCDL","name":"qshell-v2.22.1-windows-amd64.zip.md5","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain","state":"uploaded","size":33,"digest":"sha256:8a5668b248027da2a3ba088805d2f5683cd6c281cecfc7bf7937a6b81907dffc","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-18T11:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:21:21Z"},{"id":763128415,"node_id":"RA_kwDOAZbyZ84tfGpf","name":"qshell-v2.22.1-windows-arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":7831640,"digest":"sha256:fe459656d618cdd5c29d21e25f6473ecc3893b922bfa063a4895481e532a610c","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:52Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:53Z"},{"id":763128495,"node_id":"RA_kwDOAZbyZ84tfGqv","name":"qshell-v2.22.1-windows-arm64.zip.md5","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain","state":"uploaded","size":33,"digest":"sha256:e59253119eb03f60c1acda750727f7c7dd6d69ca1526a69e4a70e32a3a7e5dda","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:54Z","updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:26:54Z"}],"body":"## 沙箱列表与批量操作\n\n- `qshell sandbox list --all` 可读取全部匹配页，也可用 `--next-token` 手动翻页。默认仍只读取一页，下一页游标写到 stderr，JSON 输出保持数组格式。\n- 修复 `sandbox kill/pause/resume --all` 只处理第一页的问题。命令先读取所有匹配页并按沙箱 ID 去重，再并发处理。任一页查询失败时，整批操作在变更资源前终止。\n- 列表和批量操作使用一致的元数据过滤规则，支持 `lang=c++` 等包含特殊字符的值。显式传入空值、无效键值对或重复键时，命令报错退出。\n- 沙箱列表或批量操作遇到配置、查询或单项请求失败时返回非零退出码。执行批量变更后会报告成功和失败数量。\n\n[相关 PR #469](https://github.com/qiniu/qshell/pull/469) · [与 v2.22.0 的完整差异](https://github.com/qiniu/qshell/compare/v2.22.0...v2.22.1)\n"}
